    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file named `embed_for_search.py` in the current working directory. The file should contain code that embeds a query and documents for semantic search using a concrete external provider. I will use the Hugging Face Transformers library, which is a popular choice for natural language processing tasks, including embedding text for semantic search. The code will import the necessary components from the Hugging Face library, making it identifiable as the external provider. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861896695,
          "start": 1789861893647
        },
