      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To compute cosine similarity between two embedded texts, I need to use an external provider that offers text embedding services. One such provider is the Amazon Bedrock service, which offers a variety of pre-trained models for text embedding. I will use the Amazon Bedrock SDK to integrate with the service and compute the cosine similarity. </thinking>\n",
