        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `embed_batch.py` that generates embeddings for a batch of texts using a concrete external provider, I will select a specific service for embedding generation. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which is a concrete external provider for generating embeddings. The code will include the necessary imports and API calls to interact with Amazon Bedrock. </thinking>\n",
